# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BD-SpineX .gitignore
#
# The GitHub repo intentionally ships ONLY:
#   • app/        – the frontend panel
#   • design/     – design docs / design book
#   • core, python, experiments, manager-data – the Patch __data engine,
#     bundled converter tools, and per-version indexes
#
# Everything below keeps these OUT of the repo:
#   (1) local-only test resources (images, sample mods, generated data)
#   (2) runtime-injection research & core (loader payload, probes, notes)
#   (4) personal config & local environments
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ── Dependencies & tool caches ────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
jspm_packages/
*.tsbuildinfo
.npm
.eslintcache
.stylelintcache
.cache
.parcel-cache

# ── Build / packaged outputs ──────────────────────────────────────────────
dist
out
dist-native/**
release/**
build/Release
**/bin/
**/obj/
*.tgz
src-tauri/target/**
src-tauri/gen/schemas/**
experiments/rust-uabea-cli/target/**

# ── Logs, runtime data & diagnostics ──────────────────────────────────────
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
report.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.[0-9]*.json
pids
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock
tmp/

# ── Test coverage ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
coverage
*.lcov
.nyc_output

# ── Python ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# ── macOS metadata ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
._*
**/._*


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# (1) Local-only test resources — never committed
#     Drop local test images / sample mods into  local/  (auto-ignored).
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
local/
mods/**
!mods/
!mods/.gitkeep

# BD2 Mod Manager runtime output (generated on the user's machine).
# Per-version shared indexes ARE kept (they ship with the app); everything
# else under manager-data is local-only.
manager-data/*.json
manager-data/versions/**
manager-data/backups/**
manager-data/converted/**
!manager-data/.gitkeep
!manager-data/versions/
!manager-data/versions/*/
!manager-data/versions/*/shared-index.json
!manager-data/versions/*/shared-file-index.json
!manager-data/backups/
!manager-data/backups/.gitkeep
!manager-data/converted/
!manager-data/converted/.gitkeep

# Patch __data converter toolchain: the bundled converter is tracked, but its
# build/source/download caches stay local.
!manager-data/tools/
!manager-data/tools/**
manager-data/tools/build/**
manager-data/tools/downloads/**
manager-data/tools/dotnet/**
manager-data/tools/git-source/**
manager-data/tools/source/**


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# (2) Runtime-injection research & core — kept private (never on GitHub)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# injection research / probes / planning
bepinex-playcover/
SPINE_RUNTIME_PROBE_RESEARCH.md
# BepInEx + internal research notes
doc/
# Rust loader payload (native/bd2loader)
native/


# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# (4) Personal config & local environments — not on GitHub
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
.claude/
skills-lock.json
.venv/
**/.venv/
**/.venv-tools/
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
.vscode-test
.node_repl_history
